In this video we are going to know what are the thousands of power tools and what are the precautions.
在这期视频里，我们要了解电动工具有哪些危害，以及有哪些预防措施。

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
So let's start.
那我们开始吧。

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
So let's first talk about power tools.
我们先来谈谈电动工具。

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Power tools i.e. whatever tools you use for work, if you consider them as electrical supplies i.e. power supplies are given, they are called power tools.
电动工具，也就是你工作中使用的任何工具，如果给它们接上电源，也就是供电，它们就叫做电动工具。

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:43,000
For example, grinding machine, drilling machine, wood cutter machine, welding machine etc.
比如磨光机、钻床、木材切割机、电焊机等等。

8
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,000
So let's see what are the thousands of power tools.
那我们来看看电动工具有哪些危害。

9
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Power tools are used and it is called power i.e. electrical power supply.
使用电动工具，之所以叫“电动”，是因为它用的是电源供电。

10
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
So the important thing is that the thousands of power tools are called electrical shock.
所以重要的一点是，电动工具的危害就是所谓的触电。

11
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
So the first thousand is electrical shock.
所以第一种危害是触电。

12
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
The second is fire and explosion.
第二种是火灾和爆炸。

13
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,000
The third is sparks.
第三种是火花。

14
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,000
In that, sparks are also produced.
在使用过程中也会产生火花。

15
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,000
The fourth is cut injuries.
第四种是割伤。

16
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:11,000
When you are using power tools, you have more chances of getting cut injuries.
在使用电动工具时，你被割伤的可能性更大。

17
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:13,000
The fifth is burn injuries.
第五种是烧伤。

18
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:19,000
When you are using a grinding machine and any spark falls on you, it is more dangerous to burn your body.
当你使用磨光机时，如果有火花落到你身上，烧伤身体的危险就更大。

19
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,000
The sixth is noise.
第六种是噪声。

20
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Whenever you use power tools, the noise level is also high.
每当你使用电动工具时，噪声水平也很高。

21
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,000
And the seventh is vibrations.
第七种是振动。

22
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:29,000
So you understood the thousands of power tools.
这样你就了解了电动工具的危害。

23
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:31,000
The first is electrical shock.
第一是触电。

24
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:33,000
The second is fire and explosion.
第二是火灾和爆炸。

25
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,000
The third is sparks.
第三是火花。

26
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:36,000
The fourth is cut injuries.
第四是割伤。

27
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,000
The fifth is burn injuries.
第五是烧伤。

28
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,000
The sixth is noise.
第六是噪声。

29
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:40,000
And the seventh is vibration.
第七是振动。

30
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:44,000
So let's see what are the precautions of power tools.
那我们来看看电动工具有哪些预防措施。

31
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:51,000
First of all, whenever you are using power tools, you have to make sure that its power supply is 110 volts.
首先，每当你使用电动工具时，必须确保它的电源是 110 伏。

32
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:57,000
And for whatever power supply is being supplied to it, it is equipped with an ELC of 30 milliampere.
而且给它供电的任何电源，都要配备 30 毫安的 ELCB。

33
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Whatever power tools you are using, it is necessary to have a dead man switch.
不管你使用什么电动工具，都必须有失能开关。

34
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:05,000
The third is the guard of that machine.
第三是机器的防护罩。

35
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:12,000
The fourth is that no combustible material should be used in the area where you want to use power tools.
第四是在你要使用电动工具的区域内，不应使用任何可燃材料。

36
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:14,000
Or no flammable material should be used.
或者不应使用任何易燃材料。

37
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:22,000
If you are using a grinding machine and you have a wheel, that is the rpm of the disk.
如果你使用的是磨光机，而你有一个砂轮，也就是磨片的转速。

38
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:27,000
That means the rotation per minute should be bigger than the rpm of the machine.
也就是说，它的每分钟转数应该大于机器的转速。

39
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:29,000
That is, it should be more.
也就是说，它应该更高。

40
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:33,000
Whatever power tools you are using, it should be a spark containment.
不管你使用什么电动工具，都应该有火花围挡。

41
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:40,000
That is, whatever spark is being produced, you have to cover it so that the spark can go out.
也就是说，不管产生什么火花，你都要把它遮挡起来，这样火花就可以出去。

42
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:49,000
Whenever you use a welding machine and use a welding machine, you need to make a welding booth for whatever spark is produced.
每当你使用电焊机，使用电焊机时，你需要为产生的火花搭建一个焊接棚。

43
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:53,000
Whatever power tools you are using, there should be fire extinguishers.
不管你使用什么电动工具，都应该配备灭火器。

44
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Also, there should be a fire blanket.
此外，还应该有灭火毯。

45
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:59,000
And there should be a fire watchman to handle them.
还应该有一名防火监护人来处理这些。

46
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:04,000
Whatever person is using power tools, it is necessary to apply double eye protection.
使用电动工具的人，都必须采取双重眼部防护。

47
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:08,000
For example, if he is grinding, then he has to apply safety goggles.
比如，如果他在打磨，那么他必须戴上安全护目镜。

48
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:11,000
And on top of that, he has to apply a facial mask.
在此之上，还必须戴上面罩。

49
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:15,000
Whenever you are using power tools, you have to wear leather gloves.
每当你使用电动工具时，都要戴皮手套。

50
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:19,000
You should have a fire resistant apron and you should wear it.
你应该有一件阻燃围裙，并且要穿上它。

51
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:25,000
If you are using power tools, if the noise level is too high, then there is a problem in listening.
如果你在使用电动工具时噪声太大，就会影响听力。

52
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:29,000
So at that time you have to use an air plug and an air muff.
所以这时你要使用耳塞和耳罩。

53
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:33,000
If you believe that the work is of long duration, it is more of time.
如果你认为这项工作持续时间很长，耗时较多，

54
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:38,000
At that time, you have to continuously do the job rotations of that person.
这时，你就要对这个人持续进行岗位轮换。

55
